| STR | DEX | CON | INT | WIS | CHA |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 14 (+2) | 16 (+3) | 11 (+0) | 15 (+2) | 15 (+2) | 10 (+0) |

- **AC** 16 (scale mail) · **HP** 22 (3d10) · **Speed** 30 ft. · **Proficiency** +2
- **Saving throws:** STR +4, DEX +5
